      "id": 10,
      "prompt": "Simplify $i^{23}$.",
      "answer": "$-i$",
      "solution": {
        "steps": [
          "Powers of $i$ repeat every $4$, so reduce the exponent modulo $4$.",
          "$23=4\\cdot 5+3$, so $i^{23}=i^{3}$.",
          "Since $i^3=i^2\\cdot i=(-1)i=-i$, we get $i^{23}=-i$."
